.TH SDL_GetKeyName 3 "SDL 3.5.0" "Simple Directmedia Layer" "SDL3 FUNCTIONS"
.SH NAME
SDL_GetKeyName \- Get a human-readable name for a key.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <SDL3/SDL_keyboard.h>
.PP
.BI "const char * SDL_GetKeyName(SDL_Keycode key);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
If the key doesn\(aqt have a name, this function returns an empty string (\(dq\(dq)\[char46]
.PP
Letters will be presented in their uppercase form, if applicable\[char46]

.SH FUNCTION PARAMETERS
.TP
.I key
the desired
.BR SDL_Keycode
to query\[char46]
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns a UTF-8 encoded string of the key name\[char46]

.SH THREAD SAFETY
This function is not thread safe\[char46]

.SH AVAILABILITY
This function is available since SDL 3\[char46]2\[char46]0\[char46]

